{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>深水埗發生車禍。本周六（6日）晚上11時許，一輛私家車駛至福華街近桂林街衝上行人路，撞到一間店舖外牆和兩名女子，其中一名女子腳部受傷，清醒由救護車送院治理，另一人拒絕求醫。</p><p>根據網上圖片，該輛私家車剷上行人路，車頭損毀，左邊貼住黃色地舖牆身，另有一名身穿睡衣的女子在車旁，有傷者坐在擔架上。</p><p>消息稱，警方正調查事件，司機暫時不知所終。</p><figure><img alt=\"（Threads@ko.09_322圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260607/1140082266551357440865349.jpeg/8h0qMCOycbIVUlZRt82f4ZEQsOzJ-27dFWjF2RVoxdk\"/><figcaption>（Threads@ko.09_322圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（Threads@ko.09_322圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260607/1140082263938174976052317.jpeg/A5Z7fL_NVYQtTXrLO2mG1DShbi8Q6mBgSWgeFkloHhY\"/><figcaption>（Threads@ko.09_322圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（Threads@ko.09_322圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260607/1140082260943310848092478.jpeg/gMMAwolZBVNMQ5TIOYk4FpujRoAUEjJEqTCYsKkwmLA\"/><figcaption>（Threads@ko.09_322圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-06T16:19:49.501360+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":233,"images":3,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}